WEBVTT

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.670
Master! Turn on the water!

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.830
Okay!

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.330
Baseball?

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:45.110
That's right. Baseball.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.220
What say we play
for drinks?

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.060
Drinks?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:52.700
If my team loses, I'll
pick up the tab for everyone.

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:54.400
And if my team loses?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.060
Then drinks are on the house!

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.840
I had no idea you had a team.

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:03.060
It's a brand new team
of shopkeepers.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.310
So everyone's about your age?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:11.320
If we don't keep active,
we'll never get rid of this.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.320
If everyone's a shopkeeper,

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:16.230
the average age
should be 45 or 46.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.050
And just about everyone's
got that middle-age spread...

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.420
It's not a bad deal.

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:24.260
What do you say, Master?

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.330
If you win, you'll have
at least 20 customers.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.920
Yeah, Master! Let's do it.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:37.380
Hm... But I don't
have a team.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.010
I'll take care of it!

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.800
Grandma, can you get
a team together?

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.420
Leave it to me!

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.290
I'll get a team
together for you.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.670
Huh? You're
the coach, Grandma?

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:08.950
That's right.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.760
Yusaku, you bring
that friend of yours.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.230
You'll get to drink
after the game.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.550
But I'm busy
with my job hunt.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.510
C'mon, the game's on Sunday.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.480
But it's no fun playing
against a bunch of old geezers.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.580
Such harsh words, Godai.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.600
Grandma, may I
ask you something?

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.550
What is it?

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:36.670
What do I need to
wear to the game?

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:39.430
I don't have any
exercise clothes.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.960
Don't worry about it.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.980
Master's going to
get us some uniforms.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.380
Great.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.980
So are you in, Yusaku?

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.980
Of course, I am.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.950
And you want me to
bring Sakamoto, right?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.160
Believe it or not

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.450
my goal was
to get to Koshien.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.480
I thought you played
rugby in high school?

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.990
You had nothing
to do with Koshien.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:06.140
One lie leads
to a bigger lie.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:10.170
I used to be on the cheering squad
for our baseball team.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.300
Doesn't matter.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:16.170
We got him to play,
thanks to the manager.

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:16.900
Huh?

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:21.210
All we need now
is Coach Mitaka.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.020
What? You're going to
play as well, Ms. Otonashi?

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.730
Of course I'll be there.
This Sunday?

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.250
Sure. I'd love to participate.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:38.920
Shoo! Shoo!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:44.910
No, it's nothing.
I'll see you then!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:05:00.240
We won't lose to a team
of women and kids!

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:02.750
Play ball!

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.240
Let's go!

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:08.880
Good luck, Godai!

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:11.300
Just you watch!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.230
Ms. Otonashi, I
promise you a victory.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:19.530
We absolutely
can't lose, team!

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.410
NO!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.110
I see you're
signaling something,

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.020
but are you sure you can
pitch what you're signaling?

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.550
I'll show them!

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.160
I'll strike out
three batters in a row.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:39.790
Take this!

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:40.900
Got it!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:43.050
Akemi! Get it!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.190
Oh no!  It's coming!

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.930
Run! Run!!

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:52.410
Damn!

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:00.210
All right! He got it!

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.250
Run! Run for our first point!

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.690
Master, I hope you're ready
to throw us a party tonight.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:23.460
Right. And you better have
the cash to pay for it.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:28.560
Oh, no!

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.400
Right! Right!

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.900
Hey!

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.850
C'mon, Ma! Play the game!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.810
YOU play!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.690
Perhaps I erred on
the team selection.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.300
Did you see that?!
I caught it!

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.290
Throw to third! Third!

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.270
But it's mine!
I got it.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:59.840
Don't hang onto it!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.710
Will you treat if
I throw it to third?

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.350
C'mon!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:07.050
Well, I guess I'll
throw it to third.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.300
Here it comes, Mitaka!

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:10.980
Too high!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.220
This team's worse than I thought.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:22.420
My blood pressure's rising.
This team's trying to kill me.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.820
Seven runs in one inning!

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.860
Don't let 'em hit, pitcher!

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:37.280
Kentaro! Concentrate!

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:40.430
Go, Kentaro!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.610
Even if I serve the
cheapest liquor

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.550
and offer only peanuts, hmmm...

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.610
Coach! Let's switch pitchers.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.290
I can't handle this
expense if we lose!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.160
Good idea.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:56.560
I think I can rise to
the team's expectations.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.530
Not you. Coach Mitaka.

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.360
Great! It's a photo op!

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:05.600
Well, if you insist...

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:10.800
It doesn't matter who pitches.
Our defense sucks.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.240
You think so?

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.720
Our infield isn't so bad.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.540
Why do you let them
hit to the outfield?

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:22.550
Yeah. You're the idiot
for letting 'em hit to me.

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:25.750
You're pitching to the
same spot every time!

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:29.020
You don't trust us infielders.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:34.030
Don't blame Godai. We're
only seven points behind.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.630
"Only" seven points.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.530
Ball four!

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.640
Who's next at bat?

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.440
Oh. Me.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.020
Ball four!

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:01.890
Good going!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.560
Take that!

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.060
Their strike zone
is too low!

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:12.560
If the manager makes it to first,
bases will be loaded.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.800
Ms. Otonashi, choose your balls!

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.100
Manager!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.470
Go, Manager!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.020
Okay!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:27.100
I just know my scheme will work.
He's a dirty old man, after all.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.880
That uniform sure
looks hot on her.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.620
I'll pitch an easy ball
just for you, Kyoko!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.050
Thank you!

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:39.080
Here!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.260
Yeah!

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.870
Take that! That's my
Spellbinding Uniform Scheme!

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.560
It's nothing
to brag about.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:53.700
One out, and bases are loaded.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.410
Second! Second!

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:58.150
Out!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.310
Too bad!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:03.250
Now I'm mad!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.420
She's ruined my
Spellbinding Uniform Scheme!

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:10.590
Here's my chance
to really shine.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.670
At least you look good!

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:21.970
Manager! Here I go!

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.560
Go, Godai!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.550
I don't think so.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:31.680
You just try and
hit my fast ball.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.170
Oh, no!

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:40.000
Hit by pitch!
Go to first!

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:42.370
Are you all right, Godai?

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:45.890
I'm all right. It's
all a part of our strategy.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.090
Great job, Godai.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:53.370
I'm impressed with
your team spirit.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.510
Shucks. I didn't mean to
tense up my shoulders.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.970
What?!

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.010
He's so cool!
I sense a homerun!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:11.080
Don't take me lightly, punk.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:13.850
Go, Mitaka!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:18.900
Ms. Otonashi, I'll dedicate
this homerun to you!

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:22.370
Idiot. He's such a grandstander.

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.270
He may look good,
but he won't deliver.

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.560
Let's see you embarrass yourself.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:33.390
I did it!  I did it!

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.570
Great! Mitaka
look this way!

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.990
We're ahead by three!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:52.720
Watch me, Kyoko. I'm going
to win this game for us.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:55.660
Go, Godai!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.910
I'll  do  it!

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.710
Strike! Batter out!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.970
Strike! Batter out!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.950
You're on a roll!

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:15.790
What's going on?

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:17.880
He's going to strike out
three batters in a row.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.420
Great is the power of love.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:25.420
Great job, Godai!
Keep it up!

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:26.420
No way.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:27.900
Here goes!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.600
Godai!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.510
What's Kozue doing here?

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:41.410
Godai, what's going on?
Get on with it!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.380
Yes!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.940
I gotta pitch
another strike.

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.170
Mr. Godai?!

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.150
Oh, no!

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:24.330
Godai!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.780
Mr. Godai!

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.520
GO!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.520
Strike!

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:36.050
Come on, Godai!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.610
Yes!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:42.750
Who called those two?

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.620
Mrs. Ichinose?
I brought you a snack.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:49.530
Thanks, but you know I didn't
invite you just for this.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.400
No problem.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.070
Calling you was
a great idea.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.770
What do you have?

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:58.500
Here you go, Mr. Yotsuya,
just like I promised.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.410
"Mr. Yotsuya"?

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.200
He's my tutor.

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:04.840
Oh.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:05.740
Who are you?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.190
I'm Godai's friend.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:11.060
Grandma, please have some.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.450
Here, Grandma.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.900
Thanks, you two.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.320
-No problem!
-No problem!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:25.070
I-I don't like her.

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:28.230
I'll finish you off.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.460
Go, Godai!

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.170
Go, Mr. Godai!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.730
Strike! Batter out!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.100
Two out!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.680
It's not easy having
a big cheering squad.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.220
Ms. Otonashi! Here I go!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:55.850
We're counting on you!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:59.620
I'll get you this time, punk.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.070
Go! Go!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.710
Ouch!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.560
Are you all right?

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:22.520
Ouch!

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.250
You better not move.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:25.430
Let's take him to the bench.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:26.960
Slowly.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.250
Ow!

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.450
Hang in there.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.160
I'm sorry.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:36.730
What'll we do? We don't
have any alternates.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:41.270
I know! You join our team.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.230
Huh?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.810
Great idea. You hurt
him, you replace him.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:50.710
Wait a sec. We only have
nine people on our team.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:51.820
Yeah!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:54.290
That's not our problem.

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.250
It's not that simple.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.120
Who else could replace him?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.190
I'll play!

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.220
I wanna play, too!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.400
What perfect timing.

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:09.640
Coach Mitaka is our
most valuable player!

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:15.200
I wonder... I don't think
we'll miss him much.

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:18.370
Really? I don't think you
know what you're saying.

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:19.450
All right.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:23.890
If you give us six points,
you can have Coach Mitaka.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.790
Six points?

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:38.230
Then we'll be tied!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:39.770
No way!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:42.440
Three. I'm willing to
give you three points.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.410
All right. It's a deal.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.310
We're only three points behind.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.600
Let's go!

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.670
What kinda team is this?

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.970
Yagami! Here we go!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:53.730
Yes!

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:58.890
She's not bad.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.430
Keep that up!

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:03.690
Hey! Where's Ma?

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.560
Huh? Where did she go?

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:13.720
Mrs. Ichinose is over there.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.230
Gosh.

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:22.770
Coach, what's your call?

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.420
Kozue Nanao will replace
Ichinose in the right field!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.000
Yes!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.090
I don't know about this.

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:39.600
Manager!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.600
I'm sorry, Yagami!

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:48.530
Don't tell me you missed
my ball on purpose.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.080
Oh, no!

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:03.700
You're doing great, Kozue!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.360
I caught it?

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.690
Look! I caught it, Godai!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.400
Good job, Kozue.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.040
I hit it? I hit it!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.770
Run! Run!

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:34.580
Okay.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.230
Not that way! This way!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.010
This way?

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:38.740
That's right!

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:39.970
Okay!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.520
Wow!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:51.940
What're you doing? Run!

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:54.000
You're amazing.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.400
Out!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.340
You're out if
the runner behind you

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.340
gets ahead of you.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.450
Huh? No way!

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:07.650
Don't let him hit, pitcher!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:19.810
Huh?

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.900
Ball!

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:25.630
Bases are loaded.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.880
If only I can hit
a homerun

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:32.880
it'll be a great comeback!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.800
Godai, choose well.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:39.140
If the runner comes home
we're tied.

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:40.860
Leave it to me!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.310
I'm counting on you!

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.430
Go, Godai!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.250
Hit it, Godai!

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.860
Time out! Relief Mitaka!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:54.720
Mitaka?!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.520
Put a little spin on it.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.990
You can count on me.

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:07.650
Godai, I'm sorry.
It's all over now.

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:12.120
No way.
I'm hitting a homerun.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:16.040
Do you have what it takes
to hit my fastball?

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.650
They used to call it
"the Little League Falcon. "

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:20.990
I won't lose to you!

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.860
Strike!

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:28.520
Damn!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.720
Come on, Godai!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.220
Forgive me, Ms. Otonashi.

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.840
I just can't let
you have this game.

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:40.910
Strike two!

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:42.730
What's wrong, Godai?

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:44.890
-Mr. Godai!
-Godai!

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.040
One more pitch,
and you're finished.

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.920
Don't fight the ball.
Just hit the ball.

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:57.040
Godai, this is it!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:58.310
Oh, no!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.420
Got it!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.060
Wow!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:02.830
Go!

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:07.260
Timeout! Pinch hitter!

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:09.260
Pinch Hitter?!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.000
Grandma, there's no one
else to replace him.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:13.450
I'll do it.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:23.040
Coach Mitaka
It's you against me!

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:26.450
Gee whiz. If I
don't let her hit

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:28.780
I'll never hear
the end of it.

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:30.620
No need to hold back.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:32.860
Yeah, right.

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:34.450
Mitaka!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.430
Observe! Silver Power
at its best!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:40.330
NO!

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.670
Yeah! Run!

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:52.000
Kyoko! Go!

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:55.970
Ms. Otonashi, I'm sorry!

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:57.240
No you don't!

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:07.130
Safe! Game over!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:12.790
Yeah!

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:18.680
Did we win?

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:21.340
Yes. We made an
incredible comeback!

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:22.840
Yeah!

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:23.770
Manager!

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:50.060
Why don't you
order better snacks?

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.530
Peanuts are just fine!

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:54.040
I won't pay if you
serve anything else.

00:22:56.780 --> 00:22:58.650
Are you okay, Mr. Godai?

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.230
Does it hurt, Godai?

00:23:00.330 --> 00:23:01.750
Impressive.

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:03.620
I didn't know you were
so into the game

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:04.950
that you hurt
yourself so badly.

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:07.740
I got all these injuries
after the game.

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:22.290
I need to train harder.

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:48.350
What's this, Yusaku?
A hickey?

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:49.860
Hickey?!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:50.800
She's right.

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:52.540
Way to go, Yusaku!

00:23:52.600 --> 00:23:54.770
N-No! It's not what you think!

00:23:54.840 --> 00:23:58.210
Next time:
"Underwater Confusion!
Godai's Suspicious Hickey!"

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.980
Say, did you see Manager's face?

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:02.680
Sure did!
